stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued: durable job created
    queued --> running: worker claims lease
    running --> completed: assistant output committed
    running --> failed: safe terminal failure committed
    running --> cancelled: conversation archived or cancellation requested
    running --> queued: lease expires before terminal commit
    queued --> cancelled: cancelled before claim
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
